    "title": "Heartwarming moment military mom reunites with her daughter - NewsBreak",
    "text": "4 hours ago A second grader reunited with her mom, who serves in the military. She was given a box at school with a golden lamp, a nod to the movie ‘Aladdin,’ which she loves to watch with her mom. The seven-year-old held the lamp and wished for her mom to return. Then, moments later, she got a chance to give her mom a hug in real life. NBC News’ Tom Llamas reports. Read full article",
